WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.240
From 2023 everyone wanting to vote&nbsp;
in the local government elections&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.720
will need to provide photo ID&nbsp;
when visiting the voting booth.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:21.960
You can use your passport, full&nbsp;
or provisional driving license,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.240
blue badge, proof of age ID&nbsp;
cards with pass verification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:33.720
local travel cards such as bus passes, and&nbsp;
other official government issued documents.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:45.600
Make Friday April 21st you'll find it Friday.

